  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Desk of the Alliance for Justice and Peace in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the Trade Desk will be as follows:

1.	To improve AJPSA&apos;s capacity to engage in debates and actions around trade policy in the region and in relation to the rest of the world.
2.	To generate analytical, research-based and appropriately formatted information and resource materials on trade justice.
3.	To provide a platform for faith-based reflection and advocacy on trade issues by activists and church leaders in the region.
4.	To strengthen collaboration on socio-economic justice advocacy amongst Justice &amp; Peace commissions and department&apos;s in the region.
5.	To facilitate the sharing of information and opportunities for discussion in AJPSA on trade justice issues at major regional trade meetings, so as to contribute to deepening and broadening trade-related policy development processes and debates in SADC.</narrative>
  </description>
